#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:1
msgid "接入 Viobot2"
msgstr "Integrating with Viobot2"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **D20** 作为外部 RTK 定位终端接入 Viobot2，完成硬件连接、驱动启动、RTK 模"
"式配置和数据验证。常规使用地面版固件，默认输出 **10 Hz NMEA**。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the **D20** as an external RTK positioning terminal to Viobot2, "
"complete the hardware connection, driver startup, RTK mode configuration, "
"and data verification. Generally use the ground firmware, which outputs **10 "
"Hz NMEA** by default."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:9
msgid ""
"开始集成前，先按[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-output.md)确认输"
"出，并按[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md)完成硬件连接。根据现场条"
"件选择 4G 或 LoRa 差分链路。"
msgstr ""
"Before integration, confirm the output in [Selecting Firmware and Output "
"Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md), complete [D20 Interfaces and "
"Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md), and choose a 4G or LoRa correction link."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:11
msgid "使用要求"
msgstr "Usage requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:13
msgid "Viobot2 通过 NMEA 接入外部 RTK 定位结果，至少需要以下语句："
msgstr ""
"Viobot2 receives external RTK positioning over NMEA and requires at least "
"these sentences:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:15
msgid "GGA：提供定位质量、经纬度、高程和卫星数。"
msgstr ""
"GGA: Provides positioning quality, latitude and longitude, altitude, and "
"number of satellites."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:16
msgid "RMC：提供 UTC 时间、日期、速度和航向信息。"
msgstr "RMC: Provides UTC time, date, speed, and course information."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:18
msgid ""
"Viobot2 使用外部 RTK 时，需要在上位机设置中启用 RTK 模式。启用后，外部 RTK 数"
"据会通过 `/rtk_nmea` 话题发布给 Viobot2 使用。"
msgstr ""
"When Viobot2 uses an external RTK, it is necessary to enable RTK mode in the "
"host PC settings. Once enabled, external RTK data will be published to "
"Viobot2 through the `/rtk_nmea` topic."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:20
msgid "硬件连接"
msgstr "Hardware connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:22
msgid "USB 转串口接入"
msgstr "USB to serial port connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:24
msgid ""
"如果 D20 通过产品标配的 3.3 V USB 转 UART 转接器接入 Viobot2，需要先确认设备"
"节点："
msgstr ""
"When connecting D20 to Viobot2 through the supplied 3.3 V USB-to-UART "
"adapter, first identify the device node:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:30
msgid "将实际串口号写入 RTK 驱动 launch 文件。"
msgstr "Write the actual serial port number into the RTK driver launch file."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:32
msgid "板载串口接入"
msgstr "Onboard serial port access"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:34
msgid "如果 D20 接入 Viobot2 后部串口，常用串口号为："
msgstr ""
"If the D20 is connected to the rear serial port of Viobot2, the commonly "
"used serial port numbers are:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:40
msgid "实际接线时需要确认 TX/RX 交叉连接，并保证 D20 与 Viobot2 共地。"
msgstr "Cross TX and RX, and connect D20 and Viobot2 to a common ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:42
msgid "启动 RTK 驱动"
msgstr "Start the RTK driver"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:44
msgid ""
"先按[接入 Jetson / 树莓派](jetson-raspberry-pi.md)完成 `D20_ros_driver` 的 "
"ROS1 安装和串口配置，再启动驱动："
msgstr ""
"First follow [Connecting to Jetson / Raspberry Pi](jetson-raspberry-pi.md) "
"to install `D20_ros_driver` for ROS1 and configure the serial port, then "
"start the driver:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:50
msgid "定制版 Viobot2 若已预装驱动，只需确认配置文件中的串口号后启动。"
msgstr ""
"If a customized Viobot2 already includes the driver, verify the serial port "
"in its configuration file and start it."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:52
msgid "启用 Viobot2 RTK 模式"
msgstr "Enable Viobot2 RTK mode"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:54
msgid "打开 Viobot2 上位机并连接设备。"
msgstr "Open the Viobot2 host PC and connect the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:55
msgid "进入设置页面。"
msgstr "Enter the settings page."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:56
msgid "切换到 GNSS 设置页。"
msgstr "Switch to the GNSS settings page."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:57
msgid "勾选 RTK。RTK 和 GNSS 为单选关系，勾选 RTK 后会取消 GNSS。"
msgstr ""
"Check RTK. RTK and GNSS are mutually exclusive; selecting RTK will deselect "
"GNSS."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:58
msgid "点击确定并重启 Viobot2。"
msgstr "Click OK and restart Viobot2."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:60
msgid "验证数据"
msgstr "Validation Data"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:62
msgid "启动 D20、RTK 驱动和 Viobot2 算法后，确认 `/rtk_nmea` 有持续输出："
msgstr ""
"After starting the D20, RTK driver, and Viobot2 algorithm, confirm that `/"
"rtk_nmea` has continuous output:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:68
msgid "再确认 Viobot2 侧已经解析到 RTK 数据："
msgstr "Confirm again that Viobot2 has received the RTK data:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:74
msgid "如果 `/baton/rtk` 中 `status = 2`，表示当前 RTK 为固定解。"
msgstr ""
"If `status = 2` in `/baton/rtk`, it indicates that the current RTK is a "
"fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:76
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:79
msgid ""
"`/rtk_nmea` 持续输出，Viobot2 能在 `/baton/rtk` 中解析到定位数据；设备固定时 "
"`status = 2`。"
msgstr ""
"`/rtk_nmea` continuously outputs, and Viobot2 can parse positioning data in "
"`/baton/rtk`; when the device is stationary, `status = 2`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:82
msgid "输出话题"
msgstr "Output topic"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:84
msgid "开启 RTK 后，Viobot2 可输出融合后的定位相关话题："
msgstr ""
"After enabling RTK, Viobot2 can output fused positioning-related topics:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:93
msgid ""
"其中 `/baton/stereo3/fusion_odom` 为融合后的 odometry 输出；`/baton/stereo3/"
"lla_odom` 中的位置为经纬高，单位分别为度、度、米。"
msgstr ""
"Among them, `/baton/stereo3/fusion_odom` is the odometry output after "
"fusion; the position in `/baton/stereo3/lla_odom` is in latitude, longitude, "
"and altitude, with units of degrees, degrees, and meters, respectively."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:95
msgid "时间同步"
msgstr "Time synchronization"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:97
msgid "Viobot2 使用 RTK/GNSS 数据时，通常通过以下方式完成时间同步："
msgstr ""
"When Viobot2 uses RTK/GNSS data, time synchronization is usually "
"accomplished in the following way:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:99
msgid "板载 GNSS/PPS 同步系统时间。"
msgstr "Onboard GNSS/PPS synchronized system time."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:100
msgid "RTK 驱动解析 D20 输出的 NMEA GGA 和 RMC 中的卫星时间。"
msgstr ""
"RTK driver parses the satellite time from the NMEA GGA and RMC output of D20."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:102
msgid "接入时应确保 D20 输出 RMC，否则系统可能缺少完整 UTC 日期时间信息。"
msgstr ""
"When connecting, ensure that D20 outputs RMC; otherwise, the system may lack "
"complete UTC date and time information."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/viobot2.md:104
msgid ""
"若 D20 自身未进入固定解，先按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md)检查定位输出、差分配置和现场条件，再检查 Viobot2 驱动和话题。"
msgstr ""
"If the D20 itself has not entered a fixed solution, first check the "
"positioning output, correction setup, and field conditions according to "
"[Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md), and then check the Viobot2 driver and topics."

